  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISK granskning av IBON CPDE 2023 uppf&#xf6;ljning</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internal Control Review IBON CPDE 2023 follow up</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Follow-up of the recommendations in the ISK review carried out in 2022 regarding the 23 risks that were judged to be &quot;critical&quot; (red) and &quot;important&quot; (orange). 
IBON/CPDE&apos;s implementation and current status of these risks must be followed up. 
If it is deemed necessary, recommendations regarding the remaining need for improvement of IBON/CPDE&apos;s system for internal governance and control shall be provided. 
IBON/CPDE office in the Philippines to be visited. The review will form a basis for Sida&apos;s assessment of an agreement condition for the year&apos;s second planned payment to IBON/CPDE.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Uppf&#xf6;ljning av de rekommendationer i ISK-granskning genomf&#xf6;rd 2022 g&#xe4;llande de 23 risker som bed&#xf6;mdes vara &quot;critical&quot; (r&#xf6;d) respektive &quot;important&quot; (orange). IBON/CPDE:s implementering och aktuell status p&#xe5; dessa risker ska f&#xf6;ljas upp. Om det bed&#xf6;ms vara n&#xf6;dv&#xe4;ndigt ska rekommendationer vad g&#xe4;ller kvarst&#xe5;ende behov av f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttring av IBON/CPDE:s system f&#xf6;r intern styrning och kontroll l&#xe4;mnas. IBON/CPDE:s kontor i Filippinerna ska bes&#xf6;kas. Granskningen kommer att utg&#xf6;ra ett underlag till Sidas bed&#xf6;mning av ett avtalsvillkor f&#xf6;r &#xe5;rets andra planerade utbetalning till IBON/CPDE.</narrative>
  </description>
